    {
      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5440371950708864925\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F87ACF09F87AA.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🇬🇪\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Very impressed with Georgia.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F94.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🏔\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e The country is known for its warm people, ancient culture, local food and epic landscapes. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBut it doesn’t stop there.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5244837092042750681\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9388.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📈\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Thanks to its government’s business-friendly policies, Georgia is becoming a \u003cb\u003emajor business hub\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5204096496856733702\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29D8E.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e❎️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The country’s economy \u003cb\u003edoubled\u003c/b\u003e in \u003cb\u003e5 years\u003c/b\u003e and is still growing by \u003cb\u003e8% a yea\u003c/b\u003er.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"6278480525841667186\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F92BC.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e💼\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e International tech companies pay \u003cb\u003e0%\u003c/b\u003e corporate tax and just \u003cb\u003e5% on dividends\u003c/b\u003e and salaries.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eGeorgia is seriously underrated as a place to visit and do business.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eI\u0026#39;ll be back very soon! \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5436109324516607541\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29C88.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e✈️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
